F EnrolledIn        | SymbolSpecification.h | 219     | api,nonallocating,nonthrowing      | ✔️ | The subjects enrolled in one discipline, in declared order.
    in    Discipline  SymbolDiscipline       [-]  the discipline to read
    in    Delivered   const SymbolSubject**  [-]  receives a pointer into static storage; untouched when the count is zero
    out   -           Count                  [-]  how many subjects the discipline holds
    use   `const SymbolSubject* Held = nullptr; const auto Count = EnrolledIn(Texturing, &Held);`
    by    Source/SymbolSpecification.cpp

